The licence above covers the scripts, workflows, tests and documentation of
this repository. Three groups of files are modified copies of files of other
projects, or changes to them, and keep the terms of those projects for the
parts that come from them:

1. macos/mk-out-libs.nix, macos/mk-pkg-ffmpeg.nix, macos/mk-pkg-ffmpeg-meson.build,
   macos/mk-pkg-libpng.nix, macos/mk-pkg-mpv.nix and macos/packages.lock.nix are
   made from files of media-kit/libmpv-darwin-build
   (https://github.com/media-kit/libmpv-darwin-build), and
   macos/mk-pkg-libplacebo.nix is modelled on them. The "default" flavor of
   that recipe, the one built here, is under this licence:

