2. windows/ffmpeg.cmake and windows/mpv.cmake are made from packages/ffmpeg.cmake
   and packages/mpv.cmake of the Windows build recipe of shinchiro
   (https://github.com/shinchiro/mpv-winbuild-cmake), as carried by
   media-kit/libmpv-win32-video-cmake and Predidit/libmpv-win32-video-cmake.
   That recipe publishes no licence. The MIT licence above applies to the
   changes made here; the parts that come from the recipe remain under the
   terms of their authors.

3. macos/immuch360-mpv-cocoa-without-swift.patch and
   macos/immuch360-mpv-objc-language.patch change the meson.build of mpv
   (https://github.com/mpv-player/mpv) and are offered under the licence of
   mpv as built here, the GNU LGPL version 2.1 or later.

The archives that the workflow builds and publishes (libmpv, FFmpeg and the
libraries linked with them) are not covered by this file: see NOTICES.md.
